{"connection_id": "BC-d1bbce55025ee7c602da", "ref": "Wisdom of Solomon 7:1", "target": "sec18", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "A mortal shaped in a mother's womb", "note": "Wisdom describes ordinary human formation in the womb from earthly mortality, a Jewish literary counterpart to the commentary's womb-to-earth connection."}
